# The on-disk format and the profile checker both mandate LF. Declaring it
# here makes the contract the repository's own instead of an assumption about
# each machine's core.autocrlf; without this, Windows checkouts convert text
# files to CRLF and TestHouseStyle correctly fails on the carriage returns.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Compiled terminfo entries are binary files in the format term(5) documents,
# committed byte for byte as tic wrote them. dinah-288.
internal/screen/testdata/terminfo/[0-9a-f][0-9a-f]/* binary
